Talking Angela is the super fun virtual star who can’t wait to dance and sing her way to the top.

Players help her stay happy and busy with day-to-day activities in her 3D world:
- Stylish makeup looks
- Wonderful wardrobe choices
- Super sweet activities
- Special sticker albums

She’s interactive. She’s customizable. She’s fun. And she’s always ready to make new friends.

From the creators of My Talking Tom, My Talking Tom 2 and My Talking Tom Friends comes the pet who’s a star in the making.

This app contains:
